==Battleground==
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (1,200%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**7 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (1,200%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (1,200%) spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
No particular strategy is needed. Bring some [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and you shouldn't have any problems.

